        "Description": "We have recieved word that Tech-Billionaire Robert Knox has contracted our services. His intention: Eliminate any threat against his daughter&apos;s F1 Championship win.\r\rYour objectives:\r-Take out the competiton, Moses Lee cannot be permitted to race.\r-Eliminate the bartender, attempted food-poisoning does not go unpunished.\r-Stomp out the mole, his loose lips are a liability.\r-Silence the braggart, his bet against her is a personal slight\r-Kill the saboteur, our victory is assured.\r\rGood luck 47.",
